OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early rain soon clearing to
OL,6,Fsunny intervals. Mostly dry in the
OL,7,Fmorning but scattered showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping in the afternoon,
OL,9,Foccasionally heavy, slowly spreading
OL,10,Fsoutheastwards. Winds freshening,
OL,11,Fblustery around showers later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPartly cloudy through the
OL,14,Fevening with showers gradually dying
OL,15,Fout. Becoming largely dry through the
OL,16,Fearly hours with clear spells. Winds
OL,17,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
