OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FSunny spells and isolated,
OL,6,Fmainly coastal showers to start. Cloud
OL,7,Fincreasing through the day, though
OL,8,Fshowers clearing. Winds falling light.
OL,9,FDry with clear spells overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,12,Fday Thursday, breezy with rain
OL,13,Fovernight. Cloudy Friday with early
OL,14,Frain clearing. Likely dry and bright
OL,15,FSaturday, with light winds.
OL,16,FTemperatures around average for early
OL,17,FSeptember.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
